# Citation metadata read by GitHub ("Cite this repository"), Zenodo and indexers.
# Keep version and date-released aligned with DESCRIPTION at every release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SEMseeker, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SEMseeker: Stochastic Epigenetic Mutations SEM Seeker"
abstract: >-
  R package for the detection, quantification and association analysis of
  Stochastic Epigenetic Mutations (SEMs) from DNA methylation data: Illumina
  methylation arrays, bisulfite sequencing and long-read sequencing. It computes
  binary SEM calls and continuous deviation metrics, aggregates mutations into
  genomic lesions, and provides association analysis and pathway enrichment.
authors:
